{"id": "t076-014", "text": "Dentist moved to Wednesday at 4:30.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to Wednesday at 4:30", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-017", "text": "Don't forget to text Isaac good luck for his interview on Thursday morning. He's really nervous about the presentation part.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Isaac good luck for his interview", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t076-018", "text": "Zoe's dog Biscuit is having a lump removed on 10/28. She's worried sick even though the vet says it's routine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having a lump removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "10/28", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried sick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t076-019", "text": "I'm driving to the airport for 6am on Saturday, so pack Friday night and leave the keys with next door.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving to the airport", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6am on Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pack", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "leave the keys with next door", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "next door"}]}
{"id": "t076-021", "text": "Duc's parents are visiting from Hanoi for a month, arriving next Wednesday. He's been deep cleaning the flat all week and is slightly panicking about cooking for his mum, who apparently judges everyone's broth. His dad is diabetic, so no sweet stuff either. They're also hoping to do a few days in Scotland while they're here, probably the weekend after next.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Hanoi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "dx1", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "judges everyone's broth", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetic", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "no sweet stuff", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "few days in Scotland", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're here", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t076-029", "text": "Giulia's brother Isaac is getting married in Florence on September 12th. The whole family is going over for a week, and she's in charge of the hen do.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married in Florence", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going over", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t076-033", "text": "Varun is nervous about his citizenship test next Monday. He's been revising on the train every morning. I should send him a message on Sunday evening, just to say good luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "citizenship test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t076-035", "text": "Kwame told me his retirement party is on the 15th, a Friday, at the cricket club. He's finally finishing after thirty-one years at the council. His wife Angela is planning a surprise slideshow, so don't mention it to him. Must get a card and get everyone in the office to sign it by the Wednesday before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retirement party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "finishing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thirty-one years at the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get everyone in the office to sign it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the Wednesday before", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t076-037", "text": "Joe said the stag in Prague has been called off. The groom's dad isn't well, so they're doing a quiet night locally instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "groom", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't well", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet night locally", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t076-038", "text": "Long call with Tiago this evening. His visa interview at the consulate is November 4th and he's been stressing about it for weeks because the paperwork keeps changing. If it goes through, they'll move to Porto in the new year, and his wife already has a job lined up there. He's also trying to learn Portuguese properly, as in the European kind, which he says is harder than it sounds. Remember to ask him how the interview went that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visa interview at the consulate", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move to Porto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job lined up", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "learn Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t076-039", "text": "Isaac has started keto. Two weeks in, says he misses bread more than he misses people. His girlfriend Zoe is doing it with him for moral support, although she admitted to a secret croissant on Tuesday. He's aiming to stick with it until his holiday in Crete on July 4th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "keto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Two weeks in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "misses bread", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "holiday in Crete", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 4th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-040", "text": "Groceries for the week, then the post office. Also need to sort my passport renewal, it expires in May.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Groceries for the week", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "the post office", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort my passport renewal", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expires", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-042", "text": "Mrs Santos next door is going to Madeira for a fortnight from Tuesday. I said I'd water her plants and feed the cat, Pepper, who only eats the expensive pouches. Her husband is staying behind because of work, but he's away most weekdays. Key is under the blue pot. She's back on the 9th, a Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Santos", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Madeira", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat, Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "only eats the expensive pouches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "away most weekdays", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th, a Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t076-044", "text": "Bumped into Wiremu and his partner Kiri at the market. They're both training for the Auckland half marathon on 3/15 and have cut out alcohol until then. Kiri is the more competitive one.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wiremu", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Auckland half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3/15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cut out alcohol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until then", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "more competitive one", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t076-048", "text": "Zoe and her boyfriend Carlos broke up over the weekend. The trip to Mexico they had booked for December is obviously off now. She seemed okay but I think she's putting on a brave face. Her mum is flying over from Dublin on Friday to stay for a bit, which should help. I should take her out for dinner next week, somewhere vegetarian since she's given up meat again.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "December"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "putting on a brave face", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Dublin", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for dinner", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "given up meat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t076-049", "text": "Booked the train to Manchester for Thursday the 23rd. Still need to print the tickets, sort a hotel near Piccadilly and find someone to take the parcel in if it comes on the Friday. Also cancel the Thursday yoga class and move my haircut to next Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "train to Manchester", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday the 23rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "print the tickets", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort a hotel near Piccadilly", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find someone to take the parcel in", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday"}, {"id": "a4", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cancel the Thursday yoga class", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "yoga class", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a5", "type": "ACTION", "text": "move my haircut", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "haircut", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "to next Saturday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t076-056", "text": "Giulia's little boy Noah turns five on Saturday. She wants something to do with dinosaurs, nothing noisy.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Giulia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns five", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants something to do with dinosaurs", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "nothing noisy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t076-057", "text": "Lovely evening with Meera, Varun and Joe. Varun is hosting a Diwali dinner on November 8th and asked everyone to bring a dessert. Meera is doing gulab jamun because she can't help herself. Joe is threatening to bring a shop-bought trifle again. I'll make the pistachio cake and should ask Varun if anyone else is coeliac apart from his cousin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Diwali dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Meera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Varun if anyone else is coeliac apart from his cousin", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Varun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t076-060", "text": "Duc mentioned he's been feeling really low since moving here. Misses his family and the food, mostly the food. I need to invite him over for pho on Sunday, or at least find a good place nearby.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since moving here"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Misses his family and the food", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him over for pho", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "find a good place nearby", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
